    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "18 Belarmine Drive is a beautifully presented and light filled three-bedroom mid terrace home, enjoying a tranquil position within one of Stepaside’s most desirable developments in Dublin 18.\r\n\r\nPresented in excellent decorative order throughout, the home offers a superb blend of modern design and everyday comfort, with bright, well balanced accommodation complemented by a private southerly facing rear garden that captures the sun from morning through to evening.\r\n\r\nFilled with natural light, the accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest wc leading through to a generous living room, where double doors open into a bright open-plan kitchen and dining area overlooking the rear garden. This is a superb space for everyday living, entertaining and family gatherings alike, with direct access to the sun-filled outdoor space beyond.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the accommodation continues to impress with a spacious landing featuring a large hot press and convenient Stira access to a partially floored attic. There are three double bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, and the stylish family bathroom.\r\n\r\nOutside, the home benefits from off street parking to the front, complemented by ample visitor parking nearby. The rear garden is a particularly attractive feature of the home, enjoying a sunny southerly orientation and designed with ease of maintenance in mind. A patio area and mature planting create an inviting setting for outdoor dining and entertaining, while a timber garden shed provides practical additional storage.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none, with Stepaside Village just a short stroll away, offering an excellent selection of everyday amenities. Additional conveniences can also be found within Belarmine itself. The surrounding area is renowned for its exceptional recreational facilities, including Fernhill Gardens, Westwood Gym, a selection of golf clubs and equestrian centres, as well as superb walking and mountain biking trails in the nearby Dublin Mountains. Dundrum Town Centre, Sandyford Business Park, Beacon South Quarter and Leopardstown Racecourse are all easily accessible.\r\n\r\nFamilies are particularly well catered for with a wide choice of highly regarded primary and secondary schools nearby, including Gaelscoil Thaobh na Coille, Stepaside Educate Together, Our Lady of the Wayside, Kilternan Church of Ireland National School and Rosemont School. Excellent transport links are close at hand, including the Luas Green Line at The Gallops, reliable bus services, and convenient access to both the M50 and N11.\r\n\r\nOffering a wonderful balance of comfort, style and convenience in one of South Dublin’s most desirable residential locations, this impressive home is sure to appeal to a wide range of purchasers, from first-time buyers and young families to those seeking to trade up locally.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall \r\nTimber flooring, alarm and storage.\r\n\r\nLiving Room \r\nTimber flooring, television point and double doors leading to:\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining Room \r\nTimber flooring, fitted floor and wall units, quartz countertop and splashback, Bosch double oven, Bosch 4 plate hob, extractor fan, fridge freezer, Whirlpool washing machine, Island unit with quartz countertop and storage, recessed lighting and access to rear garden.\r\n\r\nGuest Wc\r\nTiled floor, wc, whb, heated towel rail and understairs storage.\r\n\r\nLanding \r\nTimber flooring, shelved hot press and Stira access to attic.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nDouble bedroom with fitted carpet, box bay window and storage.\r\n\r\nEnsuite \r\nTiled floor, fully tiled walls, step in Triton T90xr shower, wc, whb and mirrored wall mounted vanity unit.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring and storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nSingle bedroom with timber flooring and storage.\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom \r\nTiled floor, partially tiled walls, bath with Triton T90xr shower attachment, wc, whb and heated towel rail."
      },
      {
